Files: src/spiflash/data/*
Copyright: 2026 Tim Ansell
License: Apache-2.0
Comment:
 Facts about flash chips (identifiers, sizes, page and sector sizes, erase
 opcodes, supply voltages, capability flags, part and manufacturer names)
 extracted by tools/update_db.py from the flash tables of the Linux kernel
 and Dediprog's SF100Linux (GPL-2.0-only), U-Boot, flashrom, flashprog,
 OpenOCD and QEMU (GPL-2.0-or-later) and openFPGALoader (Apache-2.0), at the
 commits recorded in src/spiflash/data/sources.json. No code from those
 projects is included;
 the free-text notes reproduce short comments from their tables, credited
 to the file and line they came from, and the SFDP tables of QEMU's flash
 model are the bytes the chips themselves answer. See docs/SOURCES.md.

Files: tools/spiflash_extract/*
Copyright: 2026 Tim Ansell
License: Apache-2.0
Comment:
 A rewrite of the approach of LiteSPI's tools/spi_nor_config_generator
 (Copyright (c) 2020 Antmicro, BSD-2-Clause). No code from it is included.

